      <div type="clause" n="41.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 41.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf he ladian wylle, ladie hine mid ðryfealdan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he seeks to clear himself, he shall do so by the triple mode of proof.</ab>
